From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:56:04 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] server: restore a cached prompt only when it is faster than
 running it

A prefill records seconds per token and a restore records seconds per byte. A saved state is kept and loaded only when the tokens it skips outweigh the copy. LLAMA_WARM_COST=0 disables the check.
